#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0252-B expect=noViolation domain=ADSL
#note "Negative control: a conformant subject-level dataset carrying NONE of the 44 concrete prohibited names and matching NONE of the 29 template-family regexes. Since Fix #270 (ruling M2-D3) the wildcard-free Check EXECUTES per variable and stays silent -> the rule's first true noViolation state (pre-#270 it could only report SKIPPED here - expand() returned empty and NoMatch dropped the rule; the recorded no-noViolation carve-out is retired for this family)."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
#expectViolationCount 0
dataset ADSL structure=ADSL
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col AGE     type=Num
col SEX     type=Char
col SAFFL   type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | 56 | M | Y
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1023 | 61 | F | Y
